or components in antenna keepout.\nUse a 15 mm clearance beyond the antenna where possible.\nKeep LED data and AMP_ENABLE low during startup." (at 230 200 0) (effects (font (size 1.65 1.65)) (justify left top)) (uuid e6990576-9163-5147-a0c9-77dae7e1df07))

